<title>USA: Tradelink confirms in talk with Vector.</title>
<headline>Tradelink confirms in talk with Vector.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tradelink International Ltd on Monday confirmed it is in talks with Vector Aeromotive Corp, with the intent of becoming Vector's controlling shareholder.</p>
<p>The company said litigations surrounding Vector, which had been a hinderance to the negotiations, have been resolved. They did not detail the nature of the litigations.</p>
<p>Vector suspended its automotive manufacturing operations on November 9 and has since been attempting to secure new financing that would allow it to restart operations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
